{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>They shall not make bald patches.</b> Even though I permitted them defilement for their deceased close relatives, to do them honor, I did not permit them to go to extremes in mourning so as to increase the honor of their deceased through bald patches and scratching, as the Sages, of blessed memory, stated: מַה לְּהַלָּן עַל מֵת, אַף כָּאן עַל מֵת — just as there it concerns the dead, so too here it concerns the dead (Torat Kohanim 1:3)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:10.633048578Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}